            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "The Teenage Chef"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I enjoyed this recipe and so did my family. I drizzled chocolate instead of dipping, and I created a variation using lemon extract and lemon icing for the drizzle. They were a huge hit! I love this recipe but, I did find that the cookies became spongy after only one night! Any Tips?",
